5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. Let us embark on this journey with open hearts. I believe a calm mind and a spirit of cooperation will lead us to the truth.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree that staying calm is important. Let's just proceed carefully.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm May. I'll be relying on my gut feeling for this. Sometimes a vibe tells you more than a logic puzzle, don't you think?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good day. I believe a systematic approach is best. We should focus on factual leads and eliminate possibilities logically to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay, a game! I'm Sakura! I'm gonna find the bad guy with my super-duper detective skills! Hehe, you better be careful!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is fascinating to see such different perspectives. While intuition has its place, I encourage us to lean toward logic to ensure we do not mistakenly punish an innocent soul.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Logic is safer, but people can fake logic. We should watch for those who try too hard to sound rational.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, Misaki! That's why I love the ""vibe"" check. If someone feels cold or too calculated, they're probably the wolf. I'll follow whoever feels the most honest.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"While intuition is subjective, we can use it as a starting point. However, the final decision to execute should be based on verifiable inconsistencies in behavior.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Boring! Logic is like homework! I think we should just guess and see who gets all nervous! That's the fun part, right?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience, Sakura. The beauty of this trial is not in the haste, but in the discovery. Let us listen to one another with kindness and clarity.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I think we should avoid rushing into accusations. Let's see how everyone behaves once the first night passes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,May,,"I'm already getting a feel for you all. Servas is so poised, it's almost too perfect! But I like the energy here. This is going to be fun.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. Observation is key. We should document who supports whom and who contradicts themselves as the days progress.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@May, are you calling Servas a wolf already? Teehee! You're so fast! I'm just gonna play and have a blast!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"I welcome your scrutiny, May. Truth is like a diamond; it only shines brighter when polished by questioning. Let us trust the process.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm satisfied with our general approach. Let's move to the night phase.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,May,,I'm ready! I'll be watching all of you very closely. Don't try to hide your vibes from me!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall remain observant. Let us hope for a peaceful night and a clear path toward the truth tomorrow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Nighty-night everyone! I hope I don't have any scary dreams! Just kidding! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
