31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"The sun rises again. Let us reflect on our words and actions. If anyone has discovered a truth, I invite you to share it logically.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It's still very early. I don't think we have enough information to point fingers yet. We should be cautious.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"I don't know, I'm feeling something. @Jonathan, you're being very ""by the book."" It's a bit suspicious, isn't it?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Being systematic is not a crime, May. It is the most efficient way to protect the village. I have no reason to suspect anyone yet.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, a fight! @May is attacking @Jonathan! This is getting exciting! I think everyone looks super innocent today!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Let us not let emotions cloud our judgment. @May, is your suspicion based on a specific inconsistency, or merely a feeling?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I think May is just being impulsive. We shouldn't base a vote on a ""vibe"" this early. It would be a waste of a vote.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"It's not just a vibe, it's a pattern! He's trying too hard to be the ""smart one."" Usually, the wolf hides behind a mask of rationality.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we execute based on personality traits rather than evidence, we are playing into the werewolf's hands. We need a factual lead.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe the wolf is just really shy! Or maybe they're a prankster like me! Hehe, imagine if I was the wolf! Just kidding!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, we must be careful. If the Seer has found a lead, now would be a wise time to guide us, though we must protect their identity.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"If the Seer speaks too soon, they become a target. I think we should wait and see if anyone slips up in their responses.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm sticking with my gut. Jonathan's defense is a bit too polished. @Servas, you're very calm, but are you *too* calm?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Calmness is not evidence of guilt. However, May's insistence on intuition over facts is a strategy that often benefits the werewolf by creating chaos.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Chaos is the best! But @May, you're accusing everyone! You're like a little angry bird! Chirp chirp!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us return to the center. Since we lack concrete evidence, we must decide if we risk a vote or seek more information. Logic suggests caution.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Servas. Voting randomly is dangerous. Let's look for contradictions instead of attacking personalities.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"Fine, but I'm keeping my eye on Jonathan. He's just too perfect. I'll trust Servas for now because he's actually being nice.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I accept your scrutiny. I will continue to analyze the dialogue. For now, the most inconsistent behavior has been the reliance on ""vibes.""","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I can't decide! Everyone is so funny! I'll just vote for whoever seems the least sparkly today! Teehee!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
