63,2,1,talk,Servas,,A tragedy has struck. We lost Jonathan to our own hands and May to the night. We must now find the wolf with even greater resolve.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's a heavy loss. But the fact that May was attacked suggests the werewolf wanted to remove someone who was vocal, even if she was impulsive.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Oh no! May is gone! Who could be so mean? I'm so sad! Now there's fewer people to play with!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Grief is natural, but we must use it as fuel for our focus. @Misaki, @Sakura, let us examine the remaining possibilities.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Since Jonathan was executed and May was attacked, the wolf is among us three. We need to be very careful now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Only three of us? That's scary! I'm just a little girl, I can't be the wolf! I'm too cute to be a scary monster!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Cuteness is a charming veil, Sakura, but we must look beneath it. @Misaki, you have been very quiet and agreeable. Does that hide a secret?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm simply trying to keep the peace and avoid mistakes. I don't see why being calm is suspicious now that it was Jonathan's trait.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Sakura,,@Servas is being a meanie! Why are you picking on everyone? I think Misaki is nice! Let's all just be friends!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
