73,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"And if you are the wolf, Servas, you are using your ""kindness"" to lead the suspicion toward me. It's a classic tactic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Sakura,,Stop it! Stop it! You're making me dizzy! I'll just vote for the person who's being the loudest!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
